  "prefLabel": "Csp 402.04 Eligible program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 402.04 “Eligible program” means any eligible associate degree program, any eligible bachelor’s degree program, or any eligible certificate program offered by participating institutions.\n\nSource. #13144, eff 12-9-20 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Csp 400); ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
